                <pb facs="0664" n="648" sameAs="frus:frus1949v02/pg648"/>

                <head>Political relations of the United States and El Salvador</head>
                <p>[On January 21, 1949, the United States established diplomatic relations with the
                    Council of Revolutionary Government which had assumed power in El Salvador in
                    December 1948. For pertinent documentation, see <ref
                        target="frus:frus1948v09/pg_116">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1948, volume IX, pages
                        116</ref> ff.]</p>
            </div>
